{"assets":["/statement-assets/20e433b38c22dde9dcf8fce11fdb2565cedc0830c19e13929691a891b0584373.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"610","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Harmony Analysis"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The semester is already ending, so Danil made an effort and decided to visit a lesson on harmony analysis to know how does the professor look like, at least. Danil was very bored on this lesson until the teacher gave the group a simple task: find "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" vectors in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":"-dimensional space, such that every coordinate of every vector is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and any two vectors are orthogonal. Just as a reminder, two vectors in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":"-dimensional space are considered to be orthogonal if and only if their scalar product is equal to zero, that is: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/20e433b38c22dde9dcf8fce11fdb2565cedc0830c19e13929691a891b0584373.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Danil quickly managed to come up with the solution for this problem and the teacher noticed that the problem can be solved in a more general case for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2k"},{"kind":"text","text":" vectors in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2k"},{"kind":"text","text":"-dimensinoal space. When Danil came home, he quickly came up with the solution for this problem. Can you cope with it?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of the input contains a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ k ≤ 9"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2k"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines consisting of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2k"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters each. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th character of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line must be equal to '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" * "},{"kind":"text","text":"' if the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th coordinate of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th vector is equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", and must be equal to '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' if it's equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". It's guaranteed that the answer always exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are many correct answers, print any."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"++**\n+*+*\n++++\n+**+"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider all scalar products in example:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Vectors "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"( + 1)·( + 1) + ( + 1)·( - 1) + ( - 1)·( + 1) + ( - 1)·( - 1) = 0"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Vectors "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"( + 1)·( + 1) + ( + 1)·( + 1) + ( - 1)·( + 1) + ( - 1)·( + 1) = 0"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Vectors "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"( + 1)·( + 1) + ( + 1)·( - 1) + ( - 1)·( - 1) + ( - 1)·( + 1) = 0"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Vectors "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"( + 1)·( + 1) + ( - 1)·( + 1) + ( + 1)·( + 1) + ( - 1)·( + 1) = 0"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Vectors "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind"